    {
      "name": "dsh-antigravity-acp",
      "title": {
        "en": "Antigravity ACP · Development Preview",
        "zh": "Antigravity ACP · 开发预览"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Local official agy ACP adapter reusing the existing CLI login. Every model request is rerouted through a loopback sanitizing gateway that strips non-DSH tool declarations and rewrites the system prompt; malformed requests are never forwarded. Text and image input both pass through, and an upstream refusal is reported as an explicit error instead of a fake answer.",
        "zh": "复用本机官方 agy 登录的 ACP 模型适配器。所有模型请求改道本机净化网关：删除非 DSH 工具声明、重写系统提示，解析失败即拒绝转发。文本与图片均可直传，上游拒绝（如 429）会明确报错而不是变成假回答。"
      },
